681
00:57:32,157 --> 00:57:35,826
<i>Oh, I see how it is</i>

682
00:57:38,163 --> 00:57:41,916
<i>Rapunzel knows best</i>
<i>Rapunzel's so mature now</i>

683
00:57:42,000 --> 00:57:45,002
<i>Such a clever grown-up miss</i>

684
00:57:45,504 --> 00:57:49,090
<i>Rapunzel knows best</i>
<i>Fine, if you're so sure now</i>

685
00:57:49,174 --> 00:57:52,551
<i>-Go ahead, then give him this!</i>
<i>-How did you...</i>

686
00:57:52,761 --> 00:57:56,138
